      ":question/problem": "A technician is configuring two battery types for a renewable energy grid. Battery $A$ is charged using wind power, and $45%$ of its stored energy comes from wind. Battery $B$ is more efficient, and $80%$ of its stored energy comes from wind. Together, the batteries must store at least $540$ units of wind-generated energy.\n\nWhich inequality represents this condition, where $x$ is the total energy capacity of Battery $A$ and $y$ is the total energy capacity of Battery $B$?"
